Z||000045||Levi||09-11-2001||12:22 PM||||I'm in Windsor, classes weren't closed today but we left school early. It's pretty crazy with the traffic, both the bridge and tunnel to the US have been closed so there is a lot of people with no place to go.<P>When I heard about it from my Prof I couldn't believe it. So many people have lost their lives. It's sad.<P>The company my dad works for is at risk here in Canada, I just got off the phone with him and for some reason they have told the employees not to leave, I'm not sure what is up with that but Dad also said yesturday was full of meetings with the big bosses. Could there have been rumors or some kind of warning before today? I'm not sure.<P>Praying might not help, but it's something I'm definitly going to do today.||||reg||1
