Z||000049||bHooper||09-11-2001||12:32 PM||||i have friend that lives on the Jersey shore, and works accross from the Chrylser building.  everyday, he rides the ferry into Manhatten... where it docks right near the towers.<P>i called him, afterwards.  he said he was on the ferry when someone said "oh sh!t a plane just het the towers"  he said when he looked up and heard the boom... it was like a bomb.<P>he said that the streets of Manhatten were like a movie, with everyone running around all over the place. <P>that was at 9:45 AM.  b4 the 1st tower collapsed.  he had planned on trying to leave, don't know if he did.  i told him to go to our old hang out on the upper west side and have a beer.<P>also, my brother-in-laws wife works near the UN building, she is stuck and cant get out!<P>this is crazy!<P>and i'm supposed to fly to St. Louis on friday!<P>------------------<BR>hoop<BR><FONT SIZE="3"><FONT COLOR="red"><B>Red</B></FONT></FONT> 86 GT 5 speed<BR><FONT SIZE="3"><B>Black</B></FONT> <u>86 SE Automatic</u>||||reg||1
